# Copy this file to `.kamal/secrets` before the first deploy.
#
#     cp .kamal/secrets.example .kamal/secrets
#
# `.kamal/secrets` is in .gitignore. This example isn't: it contains no
# secret, it just says where to get them.
#
# The registry runs on the NAS (192.168.1.7:5555) with no real auth, so this
# password is a formality, not a secret: Kamal refuses a non-localhost registry
# without one, and the registry accepts anything. It stays here in the clear on
# purpose.
KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=kamal
#
# The master key lives in config/master.key, which is gitignored. If you cloned
# the repo onto a new machine, copy it from one that already has it: without it,
# the app won't boot in production.
RAILS_MASTER_KEY=$(cat config/master.key)
